1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,400
May all peoples thrive,

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:10,400
that yearn to see the day

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,555
when wheresoever the Sun walks,

4
00:00:15,555 --> 00:00:22,000
strife shall be banished from the world.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,000
When every kinsman

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,444
shall be free,

7
00:00:34,555 --> 00:00:46,000
and not a devil but a neighbor

8
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:53,000
shall the adjoining-land's dweller be!